<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<style>
  body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f5f5;margin:0;padding:0}
  .wrap{max-width:600px;margin:32px auto;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}
  .header{background:#01696f;padding:24px 32px}
  .header h1{color:#fff;margin:0;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700}
  .body{padding:28px 32px}
  .label{font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:#888;margin-bottom:2px}
  .value{font-size:.95rem;color:#1a1a1a;margin-bottom:16px;font-weight:500}
  .ufs-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:16px}
  .uf-badge{background:#e6f0f0;color:#01696f;border:1px solid #a0c8c8;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 8px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700}
  .uf-badge.none{background:#fdecea;color:#c0392b;border-color:#e8b4b4}
  .cta{display:inline-block;background:#01696f;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;margin-top:8px}
  .footer{background:#f9f8f5;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:16px 32px;font-size:.8rem;color:#999}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="header"><h1>🔔 Nova solicitação de acesso — ToolboxWaze</h1></div>
  <div class="body">
    <p style="margin-bottom:20px;color:#444">Um novo usuário solicitou acesso ao sistema e aguarda aprovação.</p>

    <div class="label">Nome</div>
    <div class="value">{{ user.name }}</div>

    <div class="label">E-mail</div>
    <div class="value"><a href="mailto:{{ user.email }}">{{ user.email }}</a></div>

    <div class="label">Nickname no Waze</div>
    <div class="value">{{ user.wazeNickname ?? '(não informado)' }}</div>

    <div class="label">Solicitação em</div>
    <div class="value">{{ user.createdAt|date('d/m/Y \u00e0\u0073 H:i') }}</div>

    <div class="label">Estados solicitados</div>
    {% if requestedUfs is defined and requestedUfs|length > 0 %}
    <div class="ufs-grid">
        {% for uf in requestedUfs %}<span class="uf-badge">{{ uf }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="ufs-grid"><span class="uf-badge none">Nenhum estado informado</span></div>
    {% endif %}

    <p style="color:#555;font-size:.9rem">Revise a solicitação e configure as permissões de acesso por estado antes de aprovar.</p>

    <a href="{{ adminUrl }}" class="cta">Gerenciar usuários</a>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">ToolboxWaze &mdash; sistema interno de gestão Waze</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
